<?php $ceoRelContext=$ceoSectionPdo?\App\Services\AiCostForecastV2Service::latestContext($ceoSectionPdo,$ceoTargetYm):array('available'=>false);$ceoRelCategories=!empty($ceoRelContext['available'])?\App\Services\AiCostForecastV2Service::categoryRows($ceoSectionPdo,$ceoRelContext['analysis_date'],$ceoRelContext['target_ym'],0,$ceoRelContext['run_id']):array();$ceoCategoryLabels=\App\Services\AiCostForecastV2Service::categoryLabels(); ?>
<section class="ceo-v2-card"><h3>입력 신뢰도</h3><div class="ceo-v2-grid"><div class="ceo-v2-kpi"><small>회사 예상 입력완료율</small><strong><?php echo h(cpms_ceo_v2_rate(isset($ceoSummary['expected_completion_rate'])?$ceoSummary['expected_completion_rate']:null)); ?></strong></div><div class="ceo-v2-kpi"><small>회사 예측 신뢰도</small><strong><?php echo h(cpms_ceo_v2_score(isset($ceoSummary['confidence_score'])?$ceoSummary['confidence_score']:null)); ?></strong></div><div class="ceo-v2-kpi"><small>학습 기준시각</small><strong style="font-size:15px"><?php echo h(isset($ceoSummary['last_calculated_at'])?$ceoSummary['last_calculated_at']:'-'); ?></strong></div><div class="ceo-v2-kpi"><small>설명</small><strong style="font-size:14px">직원평가가 아닌 입력시점 보정자료</strong></div></div></section>
<section class="ceo-v2-card"><h3>비용항목 입력패턴</h3><div class="ceo-v2-scroll"><table class="ceo-v2-table"><thead><tr><th>현장 ID</th><th>비용항목</th><th>입력완료율</th><th>예측 신뢰도</th><th>평균 등록지연</th><th>일괄입력 비율</th><th>반복수정 비율</th><th>표본</th><th>fallback</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php if(count($ceoRelCategories)===0): ?><tr><td colspan="9">표시할 입력패턴 자료가 없습니다.</td></tr><?php else:foreach($ceoRelCategories as $row): ?><tr><td><?php echo h((int)$row['project_id']); ?></td><td><?php echo h(isset($ceoCategoryLabels[$row['cost_type']])?$ceoCategoryLabels[$row['cost_type']]:$row['cost_type']); ?></td><td><?php echo h(cpms_ceo_v2_rate($row['expected_completion_rate'])); ?></td><td><?php echo h(cpms_ceo_v2_score($row['forecast_confidence_score'])); ?> / <?php echo h($row['forecast_confidence_grade']); ?></td><td><?php echo h($row['average_input_lag_days']===null?'-':number_format((float)$row['average_input_lag_days'],1).'일'); ?></td><td><?php echo h(cpms_ceo_v2_rate($row['late_bulk_rate'])); ?></td><td><?php echo h(cpms_ceo_v2_rate($row['correction_rate'])); ?></td><td><?php echo h((int)$row['sample_count'].'개월'); ?></td><td><?php echo h($row['fallback_level']); ?></td></tr><?php endforeach;endif; ?></tbody></table></div><div class="ceo-v2-note">담당자 이름과 직원별 순위는 표시하지 않으며, 입력패턴은 예측 보정에만 사용합니다.</div></section>
